      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}\n\nI did try to find out on this issue and i found out that my HUD was indeed hidden. Dont know if it was turned off, yet was atleast hidden.\n\nFor me, what helped was to click on the VRC window on PC while in steamvr while using my quest headset and click CTRL + H.\n\nThis made the icon for my facemirror show again. \n\nYour comment and the comment from Docteh below helped alot!\n\nThanks alot!\n\nI would see this as fixed.",
