  "details": "Face mirror is fully broken for me in VRC. \n\nAnd also looking around on the internet, i found out that i was not the only one.\n\nWhatever I tried, doesnt seem to work.\n\nAs the mirror is invisible.\n\nIt used to work before, but right now its not working at all.\n\nI find it strange that its still not fixed as ive been waiting for months for it to be fixed. As i thought others would report on it as its a nice feature to have, especially for MUTES.\n\nThe face mirror is important for me because then i can keep track of my facial expressions. And also see if my facial expressions is off or on. \n\nAs a VRC MUTE it helps alot to have a face mirror.\n\nBecause of this issue i have to use personal mirror. Which isnt the same and also its much more difficult to see your face and everything going on behind the personal mirror. Its just annoying to use it in general when moving compared to staying still. \n\nAlso i use a quest headset, but im using steamVR. So I i'm not sure if I should keep quest off the platform checkmark. Yet I do it just in case. As i'm in VR through PC and not fully PC user.",
